# E2E-002 Docker build context trimming. The only Docker builds in this repo
# are the E2E-002 images (tests/docker/*); none of these paths are needed to
# build cmd/server, cmd/cli or the tests/mock module, and excluding them keeps
# the build context small and the build hermetic.
.git
**/node_modules
tests/e2e/dist
**/*.log
